			<BugServerity>3</BugServerity>
			<DynamicDescription><![CDATA[<p th:if="${funcNameisEmpty}" th:text="在+'`'+${fileName}+'`'+的+'`'+${funcName}+'`'+方法中的第+'`'+${line}+'`'+行会发生+${categoryName}+的风险。" th:remove="tag"></p>
<p th:unless="${funcNameisEmpty}" th:text="在+'`'+${fileName}+'`'+的第+'`'+${line}+'`'+行会发生+${categoryName}+的风险。" th:remove="tag"></p>]]></DynamicDescription>
			<Description><![CDATA[系统数据或调试信息通过网络流向远程机器时，发生外部信息泄露。  
  
**例如**：以下代码泄露了HTTP响应中的异常信息：  
```java
protected void doGet(HttpServletRequest req, HttpServletResponse res) throws IOException {  
    PrintWriter out = res.getWriter();       
    try {  
        //...  
    } catch (Exception e) {  
        out.println(e.getMessage());       
    }   
}
```
]]></Description>
			<Advice><![CDATA[程序不应通过系统输出流或程序日志将系统数据或调试信息输出程序。
]]></Advice>
			<References>
				<Reference type="CWE">526:Information Exposure Through Environmental Variables</Reference>
				<Reference type="CWE">497:Exposure of System Data to an Unauthorized Control Sphere</Reference>
				<Reference type="CWE">209:Information Exposure Through an Error Message</Reference>
				<Reference type="CERT">ERR01-J:Do not allow exceptions to expose sensitive information,ENV02-J:Do not trust the values of environment variables</Reference>
				<Reference type="OWASP TOP 10">2007:A6 Information Leakage and Improper Error Handling</Reference>
				<Reference type="GB/T 34944-2017 Java">数据处理:信息通过错误消息泄露</Reference>
			</References>
			<Obsolete>not</Obsolete>
			<Default>yes</Default>
			<WhiteList>yes</WhiteList>
			<Security>yes</Security>



			<Tag>security,log,exception</Tag>
			<DomainType>security</DomainType>
